@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1 extension point: expected 200 after implementation
# Контракт: GET без тіла; 200 і JSON-масив елементів { severity, count }.
# Політика нульових груп: лише наявні групи (порожній результат дає []).
# Порядок: від критичного до низького (Critical, High, Medium, Low).
# На baseline seed: High 1, Medium 1, Low 1; Critical відсутній.
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### Summary with optional status filter: expected 200, Medium 1
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Summary for status without incidents: expected 200 and []
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### Summary with status outside allowlist: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json
